const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文研究法律制度、投资者权利与金融发展指标之间的跨国关系。 阅读时先把它理解为一个被界定的问题，而不是可以脱离样本、时间和制度环境的结论。",en:"“Law and Finance” frames a bounded research question. Read the stated question together with the named sample, dates, and institutional setting rather than treating it as a conclusion that automatically travels to another market or period."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1086/250042",label:{zh:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"来源使用国家层面的法律起源、权利和金融发展指标进行比较，制度分类是研究设计的一部分。 这说明比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系是研究合同的一部分；改变其中任何一项，都可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"For “Law and Finance”, the source describes a deliberate comparison, observation window, and control relation. Those choices are part of its research contract: changing one can change the proposition being tested, even when the method label remains the same."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1086/250042",label:{zh:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"需要国家口径、法律与权利变量版本、金融发展指标、观察年份及原始编码规则。 数据字段、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原始研究分开记录，不能仅凭同名变量或最终修订数据就视为可比。",en:"For “Law and Finance”, keep the fields, their availability timing, and the sample filters separate from the original study. A same-named variable, later-revised database, or matching end-of-period date is not automatically a comparable input."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1086/250042",label:{zh:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"论文描述跨国制度与金融结果的关系；相关性和制度分类不应被改写为单一公司的治理结论。 它支持的是该来源所描述的经验或理论关系；它本身不把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"For “Law and Finance”, the source supports only the empirical or theoretical relation it describes. It does not turn association, model fit, or historical performance into causality, a directly executable procedure, or a guarantee about subsequent outcomes."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1086/250042",label:{zh:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"保留法律编码版本和国家样本，区分法律文本、执行强度和市场发展指标，并记录历史边界和缺失处理。 在做后续分析前，应把这些选择写入版本化的研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Before extending “Law and Finance”, record its sample, timing, construction choices, and source edition in a versioned note. Keep the primary-source link and access date so a later reader can distinguish a changed definition from a changed result."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1086/250042",label:{zh:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 Journal of Political Economy (1998)。国家层级的历史比较不能替代任何司法辖区当前的法律意见、监管状态或公司层面的因果判断。 若需要量化结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites Journal of Political Economy (1998) for “Law and Finance”. Its public description defines the boundary. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1086/250042",label:{zh:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Law and Finance”所公开说明的研究问题与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。国家层级的历史比较不能替代任何司法辖区当前的法律意见、监管状态或公司层面的因果判断。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Law and Finance”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
